Changes:
 openssl (3.0.22-1~deb12u2) bookworm-security; urgency=high
 .
   * Non-maintainer upload by the LTS Team.
   * CVE-2026-84782 ("DTLS Retransmits Handshake Messages From a Stale Buffer
     Offset")
   * CVE-2026-35189 ("Memory Allocation in Relative CRLDP Processing")
   * CVE-2026-54872 ("Timing Side-Channel in Scalar Multiplication for Non-NIST
     EC Curves")
   * CVE-2026-75805 ("NULL Pointer Dereference in CMP Client Revocation
     Response Handling")
   * CVE-2026-75806 ("Unauthenticated and Undersized DTLS 1.2 AEAD Record
     Causes DoS")
   * CVE-2026-77696 ("Timing Side-Channel in SM2 Signature Generation")
